          "section_5_about_and_vision": {
            "section_name": "About School, Vision & Mission",
            "about_text": "Heritage Xperiential Learning School (HXLS) Gurugram is a pioneer in progressive experiential education. Founded on dharmic principles and project-based inquiry, HXLS redefines mainstream education across an 11.3-acre green campus in Sector 62.",
            "vision_text": "To cultivate thoughtful, compassionate, and independent learners who find purpose and thrive in a dynamic, interconnected global ecosystem.",
